!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = combined analysis name: PN_rep1
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Within 3 hours of collection, GV, MI, and MII oocytes were completely denuded of their cumulous cells. Denuded oocytes were then stored in 10 uL of protein free media in slow freeze 250 uL straws and kept at -80C until RNA preparation. Likewise, preimplantation embryos used for this study were cryopreserved according to standard IVF protocols. Prior to RNA preparation, the embryos were thawed and pooled according to developmental stage. Embryos that failed to survive thawing were discarded. Blastocyst stage embryos were hatched and, using laser microdissection, were manually separated into Inner Cell mass (ICM) and mural trophectoderm.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA extraction from pooled oocytes and embryos was preformed using the Qiagen AllPrep kit according to manufacturers instructions.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Two stranded libraries were prepared for each stage using the TotalScript RNA-Seq kit (Epicentre, Cat. num. TSRNA1296). This approach enabled low inputs (5ng of total RNA/reaction), and random hexamer priming facilitated transcript coverage balance. Each cDNA library was then split and amplified for 12 or 14 PCR cycles, resulting in four technical replicates per developmental stage.
!Sample_description = Presence of two visible pronuclei
!Sample_description = Original raw file names (see readme_fastq_sequence_library.txt which is linked as a supplementary file on the Series record):
!Sample_description = 9741X1_130419_700179R_0412_AD1YHYACXX_4_1.txt.gz
!Sample_description = 9741X1_130419_700179R_0412_AD1YHYACXX_4_2.txt.gz
!Sample_description = 9741X17_130419_700179R_0412_AD1YHYACXX_8_1.txt.gz
!Sample_description = 9741X17_130419_700179R_0412_AD1YHYACXX_8_2.txt.gz
!Sample_data_processing = Raw sequencing reads were aligned to the human genome hg19 using Novoalign (v2.8, Novocraft) with the follow parameters; [-k –H –r All 50 -a CTGTCTCTTATACACATCTCCGAGCCCACGAGAC TCGTCGGCAGCGTCAGATGTGTATAAGAGACAG]. The index also included all known splice junctions as generated with the MakeTranscriptome application (USeq package, v8.8.8) based on Ensembl gene annotation.
!Sample_data_processing = Alignments from the 12 and 14 cycle libraries from the same sample were merged. Splice junction alignments were converted to genomic coordinates and low quality and non-unique reads were removed using the SamTranscriptomeParser application (USeq package, v8.8.8) with the parameters [-a 240 –b –r –p –n 1].
!Sample_data_processing = Stranded differential expression analysis on merged sample replicates was calculated with the DefinedRegionDifferentialSeq application (Useq package, v8.8.8), which uses the DESeq2 R package for variance normalization and differential expression analysis.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: hg19
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: The processed data is an excel spreadsheet containing a list of all expressed genes with expression data for sample replicates (raw count, normalize raw count, and FPKM). This file also contains the differential expression statistics for all expressed genes in all paired comparisons calculated by DESeq2.
!Sample_platform_id = GPL11154
